"type": "heading", "content": "Making and Responding to Requests"}, {"type": "describer", "content": "You use modals  like <span class=\"strong\">would</span> and <span class=\"strong\">could</span> in formal conversations to make and respond to requests.</br> The modal <span class=\"strong\">can</span> is less formal. Less formal responses are short."}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":3,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Formal \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Less formal\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">Anne</span>: I would like to speak to someone in the design department, please.</br></br> <span class=\\\"strong\\\">Secretary</span>: Could you wait, please? \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">Peter</span>: Can we go out for pizza?</br> <span class=\\\"strong\\\">Vanessa</span>: Sure. </br></br>  <span class=\\\"strong\\\">Vanessa</span>: Would you come to my place first?</br> <span class=\\\"strong\\\">Peter</span>: When?  </br></br><span class=\\\"strong\\\">Vanessa</span>: Can you be here in an hour?</br> <span class=\\\"strong\\\">Peter</span>: No problem. \\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border instruction_table_background\"}"}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": "Formal Phone Conversations"}, {"type": "describer", "content": "When you speak to an employer on the phone, you use polite, formal language. You can use the Simple Present tense to give information."}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":3,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Formal Language\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Informal Language\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Hello, my name is \u2026 </br></br>I'd like to speak to \u2026 </br>Can I please speak to \u2026 </br></br>This is \u2026 </br>I'm \u2026 \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Hi, this is ... </br>Hi, it's \u2026 </br></br>Is \u2026 there? </br>I want to talk to \u2026</br></br>Hello. </br>Hi.\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" instruction_table_background intro_table_border\"}"}, {"type": "example", "content": "<span class=\"strong\">Mr Warren</span>: Hello, my name is Fred Warren. I'd like to speak Peter Smith, please. </br><span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: This is Peter Smith."}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "regarding"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "about"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(preposition)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: This letter is regarding your application."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn3le06ob11aud01"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "These are the words to review."}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "recent"}, {"type": "definition", "content": " a short time in the past"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adjective)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Tell me about your recent jobs."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn3le06ob11aud02"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "application"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a letter to try to get a job"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: His job application looks very good. "}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn3le06ob11aud03"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "See you then."}, {"type": "definition", "content": " I expect to see you at the arranged time"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(expression)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I am coming at 9 a.m. See you then."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn3le06ob11aud04"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "website"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a place for information on the internet"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Our website is www.mechatech.com."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn3le06ob11aud05"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "cubicle"}, {"type": "definition", "content": " a small area with walls usually for one worker"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: My work cubicle is here. It has a small desk and my computer."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn3le06ob11aud06"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "message board"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a place to put written comments or things to remember"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Put the note on the message board."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn3le06ob11aud07"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "supplies "}, {"type": "definition", "content": " things you need to do your job"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Your supplies are on the desk."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn3le06ob11aud08"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "Oh boy!"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "this is going to be a challenge!"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(expression)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I have to catalogue 1000 images today! Oh boy! "}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn3le06ob11aud09"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to catalogue "}, {"type": "definition", "content": " to put items in a list, by letter or number"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(verb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Please catalogue these images for me."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn3le06ob